# Torvus Bog 01_swamp_entrance layers 3/4: CFlyerSwarms u04ec, u05a7. For tools/cov/specs/swarmbasics.py: god-mode player stands in swarm u04ec, lets
# the boids touch it, shoots every beam/charge/missile at it, boosts through it in morph ball, then
# drives the swarm's script messages (Increment/Decrement, InternalMessage0 x12 and boost kills for
# the >10 death-message queue, Deactivate/Activate, Delete at the end).
@f220 layer 3
@f230 layer 4
@f300 god 1; give morphBall 1; give boostBall 1; give missile 250; give chargeBeam 1; give darkBeam 1; give lightBeam 1; give annihilatorBeam 1; give screwAttack 1; fastmorph 1
@f380 send u04ec Activate; send u05a7 Activate
@f400 obj u04ec
@f420 tp 136.7 -74.4 26.9
@f700 obj u04ec
@f720 lockon 1
@f740 shoot u04ec
@f770 shoot u04ec charged
@f800 shoot u04ec missile
@f830 beam dark
@f840 shoot u04ec; shoot u05a7
@f870 shoot u04ec charged
@f900 beam light
@f910 shoot u04ec
@f940 shoot u04ec charged
@f980 beam annihilator
@f990 shoot u04ec; shoot u05a7 charged
@f1030 beam power
@f1040 noise 6
@f1060 tp 136.7 -74.4 26.9
@f1080 press x 30
@f1200 boost
@f1260 boost
@f1320 damage u04ec 5 0 boostball
@f1340 damage u04ec 50 0 cannonball
@f1380 press x 30
@f1450 send u04ec Decrement
@f1500 send u04ec Increment
@f1520 send u04ec InternalMessage0; send u04ec InternalMessage0; send u04ec InternalMessage0; send u04ec InternalMessage0
@f1600 send u04ec Deactivate
@f1640 send u04ec Activate
@f1700 obj u04ec
@f1720 send u04ec InternalMessage0; send u04ec InternalMessage0; send u04ec InternalMessage0; send u04ec InternalMessage0; send u04ec InternalMessage0; send u04ec InternalMessage0; send u04ec InternalMessage0; send u04ec InternalMessage0
@f1740 tp 136.7 -74.4 26.9
@f1760 press x 30
@f1840 boost
